## 6 Processes the engine starts
| Program | Door | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| `/usr/bin/bwrap` (candidate sandbox) | app::live_verifier / worker::namespace | `live_verifier.rs:35` |
| `/usr/bin/systemd-run` (transient scopes) | worker::resources | `resources.rs:135` |
| `/usr/bin/busctl` | worker::aggregate | `aggregate.rs:26` |
| `/usr/bin/curl` (ollama client) | worker::native, pinned in native.toml | `native_provider.rs:505` |
| `hee-namespace-shim` (in-namespace exec; reports `HEE3_NATIVE_STATUS_V1` lines) | worker::namespace_shim | `namespace_shim.rs:226,291-296`; parsed at `namespace.rs:1215` |
| julia `bin/analysis.jl` (offline, 1 thread) | numerical::process (**test callers only**) | `numerical/process.rs:220-231` |
| the one spawn door | worker::process | `process.rs:547` |
`plan.rs` spawns (rustc, mkfifo) are test-only (after `#[cfg(test)]` at `plan.rs:975`).

## 7 Environment read by production code
`HOME` (`main.rs:314`), `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` (`main.rs:305,376,633`). Test-build seams, compiled only under feature `headroom-seam` (10 gates in main.rs): `HEE3_TEST_HEADROOM`, `HEE3_TEST_MOUNTINFO`, `HEE3_TEST_BLOCKTOPO`, `HEE3_TEST_DAEMON_PORT`. Children get allowlisted environments (`hee3:366-371`; JULIA_* in `numerical/process.rs:220-231`, `namespace_shim.rs:45-48`).

