## 9 Deployed now (host, read-only, 2026-10-01 ~06:40)
- **Engine: not running.** `pgrep -x habitat-engine`: none. `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/habitat-engine/` holds only `control.lock` (from 2026-09-30 08:28), **no control.sock**.
- **Installed release:** `current` → `releases/38f3dfd2…` (built from cd952da; F06 host record).
- **No engine systemd unit** (only `hee3-backup.service/.timer`, the evidence backup, which is not the engine). HO-07 owns the unit.
- **ollama:** listening on 127.0.0.1:11434, pid 2508 (the toolbox daemon).
